{"role":"tool","content":"    1\t{\"meta\":true,\"id\":\"20260916-112834wy4c\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\",\"model\":\"freellmapi/auto\",\"title\":\"subagent: Read Excel file contents\",\"createdAt\":1789538314.65,\"compactedFrom\":0,\"usage\":{\"in\":63255,\"out\":3898,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0},\"digest\":\"\",\"turnMarks\":[]}\n    2\t{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Read the Excel file at D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\\\\data\\\\65afbc8a-89ca-4ad5-8d62-355bb401f61d.xlsx and output the full contents as a grid. Each cell has a color (hex code) and possibly a label like START or END. I need to see the entire grid layout. Use Python with openpyxl or pandas to read it. If those aren't available, try any other method. Output the grid row by row, showing each cell's color (hex code without #) and any label.\"}\n    3\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"I'll read the Excel file and output its contents as a grid.\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_298d267a75524212aa7c8487\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"cd D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia && python -c \\\"\\nimport openpyxl\\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(r'data\\\\65afbc8a-89ca-4ad5-8d62-355bb401f61d.xlsx')\\nws = wb.active\\nprint(f'Sheet: {ws.title}')\\nprint(f'Dimensions: {ws.dimensions}')\\nprint(f'Max row: {ws.max_row}, Max col: {ws.max_column}')\\nprint()\\nfor row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=1, max_row=ws.max_row, max_col=ws.max_column):\\n    cells = []\\n    for cell in row:\\n        fill = cell.fill\\n        color = fill.start_color.rgb if fill.start_color else 'none'\\n        # Clean hex color\\n        if color and color != 'none' and color != '00000000':\\n            if color.startswith('FF'):\\n                color = color[2:]\\n            elif color.startswith('00'):\\n                color = color[2:]\\n        else:\\n            color = 'none'\\n        label = cell.value if cell.value else ''\\n        cells.append(f'{color}:{label}' if label else color)\\n    print(' | '.join(cells))\\n\\\"\\n\",\"timeout\":30}}]}\n    4\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for bash\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_298d267a75524212aa7c8487\",\"name\":\"bash\"}\n    5\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_c8e086068f0840c0aef85f18\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"cd /d D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia && python -c \\\"import openpyxl; print('ok')\\\" 2>&1\",\"timeout\":15}}]}\n    6\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for bash\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_c8e086068f0840c0aef85f18\",\"name\":\"bash\"}\n    7\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"Let me try with a script file instead.\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_fb37a83a9f624859b55b282f\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"python -c \\\"import openpyxl; print('ok')\\\"\",\"timeout\":15}}]}\n    8\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for bash\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_fb37a83a9f624859b55b282f\",\"name\":\"bash\"}\n    9\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_4388a195c75242878b76b444\",\"name\":\"read\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"D:\\\\GoatCode-ts\\\\gaia\\\\data\\\\65afbc8a-89ca-4ad5-8d62-355bb401f61d.xlsx\"}}]}\n   10\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"    1\\tPK\\u0003\\u0004\\u0014\\u0000\\u0006\\u0000\\b\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000!\\u0000A7��n\\u0001\\u0000\\u0000\\u0004\\u0005\\u0000\\u0000\\u0013\\u0000\\b\\u0002[Content_Types].xml �\\u0004\\u0002(�\\u0000\\u0002\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u0000\\u000